    "Scan of the 1967 edition of the Clementon, New Jersey, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Surveyed in 1953; aerial photographs from 1975; field checked in 1967; photo revised in 1981; last revised in 1981; printed in 1988.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 21.8 x 26.9 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
